<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of French Cup second round matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Paris FC (III)	  0   Cannes		1</p>
<p> Vitrolles (III)	 0   Creteil (III)     0 (Creteil qualify</p>
<p>5-4 on penalties))</p>
<p> Raon L'Etape (IV)     0   Strasbourg	  1</p>
<p> Auxerre		   0   Lens		  0 (after extra</p>
<p>time)</p>
<p>(Auxerre qualify 5-4 on penalties)</p>
<p> Aurillac (IV)	   2   Gueugnon (II)     2 (after extra</p>
<p>time)</p>
<p>(Gueugnon qualify 5-4 on penalties. Score after 90 minutes 1-1)</p>
<p> Rennes		    0   Troyes (II)	 1</p>
<p> Fecamp (III)	    0   Paris St Germain  2</p>
<p> St Lo (IV)		1   Caen		  2 (after extra</p>
<p>time, Score after 90 minutes 1-1)</p>
<p> Toulouse-Fontaines    0   Bordeaux	    2</p>
<p> Red Star (II)	   1   Niort (II)	  2</p>
<p> Boulogne (IV)	   1   Laval (II)	  2</p>
<p> Clermont (IV)	   1   Martigues (II)    1 (after extra</p>
<p>time)</p>
<p>(Clermont qualify 5-3 on penalties. Score after 90 minutes 1-1)</p>
<p> Lille		     1   Lyon		  0</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>Bastia		     2  Nice		   2 ( after extra</p>
<p>time) (Nice qualify 4-3 on penalties. Score after 90 minutes 2-2)</p>
<p>To be played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Montpellier v Sochaux (II), Wasquehal (III) v Guingamp</p>
</text>
